---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Medical Disclaimer - Vitamin D Calculator"
  description="Medical disclaimer for Vitamin D Calculator. This tool provides estimates based on published research and is not a substitute for professional medical advice."
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Medical Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

      <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 p-5 rounded-r-lg">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-2">Not Medical Advice</h2>
        <p class="text-amber-800">
          The information provided by Vitamin D Calculator (vitamindcalculator.net) is for
          general educational and informational purposes only. It is <strong>not</strong> intended
          as, and must not be understood or construed as, medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment
          recommendations. Nothing on this website establishes a physician-patient relationship.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Estimates Based on Published Research</h2>
        <p>
          The calculations presented by this tool are derived from peer-reviewed scientific
          literature and publicly available data on vitamin D synthesis, UV radiation, and
          supplementation. However, these results are <strong>estimates only</strong>. Research
          in this field is ongoing, and recommendations may change as new evidence emerges. The
          models used involve simplifications and assumptions that may not reflect every
          real-world scenario.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Consult Your Healthcare Provider</h2>
        <p>
          Always seek the advice of a qualified healthcare professional before starting,
          stopping, or changing any vitamin D supplementation regimen. A healthcare provider
          can order blood tests (such as a 25-hydroxyvitamin D test) to accurately assess your
          vitamin D status and provide personalized guidance based on your medical history.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Individual Factors Matter</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Many personal factors influence your vitamin D requirements that this calculator
          cannot fully account for, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li>Pre-existing health conditions (kidney disease, liver disease, malabsorption disorders)</li>
          <li>Current medications (corticosteroids, anticonvulsants, weight-loss drugs)</li>
          <li>Pregnancy or breastfeeding status</li>
          <li>Age-related changes in skin synthesis efficiency</li>
          <li>Body composition and body mass index</li>
          <li>Genetic variations in vitamin D metabolism</li>
          <li>Sunscreen use, clothing coverage, and daily habits</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Dietary Vitamin D Not Included</h2>
        <p>
          This tool does <strong>not</strong> account for vitamin D obtained through your diet.
          Foods such as fatty fish, fortified milk, cereals, egg yolks, and mushrooms exposed
          to UV light all contribute to your overall vitamin D intake. Your actual supplementation
          needs may be lower than what this calculator suggests depending on your dietary habits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Vitamin D Calculator, its creators, contributors, and affiliates assume no
          responsibility or liability for any errors or omissions in the content of this site.
          The use of this tool and reliance on any information provided is solely at your own
          risk. Under no circumstances shall Vitamin D Calculator be liable for any direct,
          indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages arising from the
          use of or inability to use this website or the information it provides. This includes,
          without limitation, damages for loss of health, well-being, or any other losses.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">No Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          This tool is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without any warranties
          of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to the implied
          warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-lg p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Emergency Situations</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe you are experiencing a medical emergency, call your local emergency
          services immediately. Do not rely on this website for urgent health concerns.
        </p>
      </div>

    </section>

    <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-medium">
      <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline">Home</a>
      <a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline">About</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
